{"id":"e6ff6e87-b1b7-40ea-8f7f-41d8f6623016","object":"chat.completion","created":1784999171,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core_distance = case['core_distance']\\n    distances_raw = case['distances']\\n\\n    # Validate nodes\\n    missing = [n for n in nodes if n not in core_distance]\\n    if missing:\\n        raise ValueError(f\\\"Nodes missing from core_distance: {missing}\\\")\\n\\n    # Build mutual reachability edges\\n    edges = []\\n    for a, b, d in distances_raw:\\n        # Ensure a and b are in nodes (allow order flexibility)\\n        if a not in nodes or b not in nodes:\\n            raise ValueError(f\\\"Distance references unknown node: {a} or {b}\\\")\\n        u, v = sorted((a, b))\\n        mut_reach = max(core_distance[u], core_distance[v], d)\\n        edges.append((mut_reach, u, v))\\n\\n    # Deterministic sort: weight, u, v\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n\\n    # Union-Find\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n\\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n\\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n\\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    required = len(nodes) - 1\\n    for weight, u, v in edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, weight])\\n            total_weight += weight\\n            if len(mst_edges) == required:\\n                break\\n\\n    if len(mst_edges) != required:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Graph is disconnected; cannot form MST\\\")\\n\\n    return {\\n        \\\"mst_edges\\\": mst_edges,\\n        \\\"total_weight\\\": total_weight\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for the given task. The payload contains nodes (list of strings), core_distance (dict mapping node to float), distances (list of triples: [node1, node2, distance]), and a nonce (ignore). We need to compute mutual reachability MST.\n\nSteps:\n1. Validate input: ensure all nodes are present in core_distance, distances are between nodes in nodes list, etc.\n2. For each pair (i,j) where i<j, compute mutual reachability = max(core_dist[i], core_dist[j], distance). The distances list may include both directions? It seems to be unordered pairs (each pair appears once). We'll need to canonicalize: sort node names.\n3. Build list of edges: (node1, node2, weight) with node1 < node2 (string sort). Weight is computed mutual reachability.\n4. Sort edges by weight (numerical), then by node1 string, then node2 string. This ensures deterministic tie-breaking.\n5. Run Kruskal (Union-Find) to select N-1 edges. Build MST.\n6. Compute total weight sum.\n7. Return {\"mst_edges\": list of [node1, node2, weight], \"total_weight\": sum}.\n\nEdge case: if graph is disconnected, raise ValueError. But input nodes are given and distances cover all pairs? The fixtures show all pairs. But in general, we rely on distances list; if not all pairs present, it's still okay as long as MST connects all nodes. If not possible, raise ValueError.\n\nWe need to implement Union-Find (Disjoint Set Union) with path compression and union by rank.\n\nImplementation details: \n- Use Python's built-in sorting of tuples.\n- For deterministic tie-breaking, after sorting by (weight, node1, node2), we iterate.\n- Ensure no mutation of input.\n\nNow produce JSON with \"implementation\" key containing the Python source code as a string.\n\nWe need to escape the source for JSON.\n\nWrite the solve function.\n\nLet's code."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2017,"completion_tokens":986,"total_tokens":3003,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1920},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":425},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1920,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":97},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}